 for the old heads who can't huck it down big stair sets like they used to, or for rainy days that ruin a good session. Link up with friends, shred all day, and keep stacking clips.</p>","developers":["Flip Axis Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583790/d76914816624edea54a27957d889d1e22b87edba/header.jpg?t=1766886164","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3583790/1974450717/5210884e6856e5a45ac7137c551d1916a3186074/1755801479/dash_av1.mpd?t=1755803965","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3583790/1974450717/5210884e6856e5a45ac7137c551d1916a3186074/1755801479/dash_h264.mpd?t=1755803965","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3583790/1974450717/5210884e6856e5a45ac7137c551d1916a3186074/1755801479/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1755803965","id":257113305,"name":"Virtual Skate Launch Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257113305/7172f812cf934d27f26c39d2b80517a812dda5d3/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1755803965"}],"name":"Virtual Skate","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"Virtual Skate - <span